Z||000004||Cliff Pennock||06-30-2001||04:40 PM||||Yes, there are a lot of <I>hacks</I> for this version of UBB. Unfortunately, I've read too often these hacks are sometimes the cause of some good old fashioned data-corruption. This makes me a bit hesitant to use them. I don't like version 6 of UBB all that much, that's why I never upgraded.<P>Maybe we should make a wish-list of all the thing we want added and I'll see if I can either use the "official" hack or write it myself.||||reg||1
